# Copyright for new code

- **New files** you create in this repo must use:
  `# Copyright (c) Chris Paxton 2026`
  (year = current year when the file is created).
- **Do not** add `Copyright (c) Hello Robot, Inc.` (or Hello Robot license boilerplate) to new files.
- When **editing existing** Hello Robot–copyrighted files, leave their headers unchanged unless the user asks to relicense.
- Prefer a short one-line header for new modules/tests; do not paste the old multi-block Hello Robot LICENSE preamble on new files.
